      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my bosch dishwasher is showing an E15 error code and wont start. i looked at the manual but i'm not sure what to do first. how do i check the leak sensor and how can i dry out the bottom of the machine if there's water stuck down there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "E15 on a Bosch dishwasher usually points to a water-related issue, which is often the drain system or a leak sensor problem. You'll want to check the drain pump filter and hose connections first, as that's the easiest place to start. If you've found water, you can carefully remove the lower rack and use a towel to absorb as much as possible from the bottom basin. If the water is stubborn, a shop vac might be necessary, but be careful not to splash more water around.",
