      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'm looking under the kickplate now. it's really dark and cramped under there and there's definitely some water sitting in the very bottom pan. is there anything else that usually triggers this error besides a physical leak? like is there any way the sensor itself could just be malfunctioning for no reason?",
